mapping "V3600.1" source="V3600" target="214640008" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V3600 = Swedish 6-char extension of V36.0 SNOMED CT 214640008. Bundles mechanism + occupant
        + nontraffic setting + sport activity. Target SNOMED CT 437738 (214640008) is the Athena crosswalk
        target for parent V36.0 and captures only the off-public-road mechanism axis; drops occupant,
        counterpart-vehicle, and activity dimensions. Partial, weak per standards §1.
        """
}
